Thought: The IR spectra do not show a strong absorption band around 1700 cm^-1, which is typical for carbonyl groups. This suggests that there may not be any carbonyl groups present in the compound. To confirm, I will check the 13C NMR spectra for any characteristic carbonyl carbon shifts, which typically appear downfield (around 160-220 ppm).
